    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etolimuo oloiboni le Nkai oldeket loo ng'ok o lorere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, eitu edorropu enkaina o Laitoriani, eji metaa meekure meidim aitajeu, anaa eitoming'anaki enkiok enye, eji metaa meekure ening'isho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake entorroni inyi nayaua eoro, te rishata intae o Enkai inyi, naa ng'ok inyi naaisudoitie enkomom enye te intae, o metaa meekure ening intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eisarkionieki nkaik inyi to sarge neisarkionieki ilkimojik linyi te ntorroni; eiroro nkutukie inyi elejare, neitobiru ilng'ejepa linyi entorroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meetae hoo obo olo enkiguana te sipata, meetae ololo aiguana te sipata, osayia le pesho eng'idare ninche, neiro elejare, neipiru ninche esuujisho neyau entorroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiu ninche ilmosor le nturbubua neitobiru ninche orreshet te nkaji e surusuri; ore ilo oinos lelo mosor neye, ore ilo mosori odanyi nedanyuni olasurai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo rresheta ooshetu ninche nemeaku inkilani, meimulumul iltung'ana ate te nena naaitobiru ninche. Ore esiai enye naa esiaai e ntorroni, netii nkiasin o larrabal nkaik enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.3.15+ROM.3.16+ROM.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Irm 3.15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nekuetiki nkejek enye enkarrueisho, neisarisaraki aaibukoo osarge lemeeta entioto; ore ndamunot enye naa ndamunot e nkarruoisho, eliyio o enkidaata naatii nkoitoi enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meyiolo ninche nkoitoi e seriani, nemetii esipata nkoitoi enye; meetae oloim nena oitoi oyiolo eseriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eirridutua iltung'ana ing'ok enye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina kelakuaniki iyiook esipata, nemeinepu ae kata iyiook esupatisho; king'oru iyiook ewang'an, naa ng'ura, enaimin kitum, king'oru ewang'an kake te misimisi kipuo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikirrapirrapu iyiook esuntai kipuo anaa iltung'ana modook, nikirrapirrapisho anaa iltung'ana lemeeta nkonyek; nikirroro dama nikitiu anaa iloopuoito te nkinuku, ore ti atua lelo tung'ana oogol kitotiutuo anaa iltung'ana ootuata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinkurrukur pooki anaa lng'arurum le ntim nikinchir aayietu anaa nturkuluni; niking'oru esipata, kake meetae, niking'oru enjeunoto, kake kelakuaniki iyiook.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etoponari nkitarruorot ang te dukuya iyie, ore ing'ok ang neishakenoki iyiook; ore nena kitarruorot ang netii te nebo iyiook, nikiyiolo iyiook ntorrok ang: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kitigila nkitanapat nikiany Olaitoriani, nikimbelekenyate aaing'uaa esujata Enkai ang, kiimaki enkitorogonyare o engolon e nkong'u, nikidamu too ltauja nikiro ilomon le lejare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eibelekenyaki esipata, ore esupatisho netalakuana; amu eimina esipata too umat oo ltung'ana, ore enkitoriori nemetumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metii esipata, ore ilo oiwuang'a te ntorroni nepik kewan batisho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitobira Olaitoriani pee ekordu iltung'ana lenyena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etoduaa Olaitoriani ina, neitu eitiship ninye nchere eji meetae esipata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.63.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 63.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Etoduaa ninye ajo metii oltung'ani, neing'asia pee edol ajo meetae oltung'ani omitu ilo oitorogonyitae, neaku enkaina enye kewan nayaka ninye enkisulata, ore esipata enye neitasheyie ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efe 6.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.6.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TH.5.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ils 5.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eishopo ninye esipata anaa enkila o lgoo, neishop emaupe e njeunoto ten dukuya enye; neishop ninye ilkilani le lap, neimulumul kewan te mpushuna napi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te risioroto oo nkiasin enye elo ninye aitalak ninche, neitalak te ngoro lelo mang'ati lenyena; ore lelo ootii olmanie le naiposha neitalaku te ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kepuo ninche aaureyu enkarna o Laitoriani tenkalo o loo ntoluo, neimin enkitoo enye enkilepunoto e nkolong, amu kelotu ninye anaa enkare olkeju nanang'unye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.11.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Irm 11.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Naa kelotu ninye Sion anaa olalakunoni too lelo le nkaji e Yakobo ooibelekenya aaing'uaa enkitarruoroto, Olaitoriani ojo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naa ore ti alo nanu, ele olning'o lai lo sotua o ninche, Olaitoriani ojo. Ore ina kiyang'et ai natii shumata iyie, o lelo rorei laainei latipika nanu enkutuk ino, nemepuku ninche te nkutuk ino, aashu too nkutukie oo nkera inono, Olaitoriani ojo, ebaiki ena kata neito idia alo o ntarasi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
